[{"sha":"70f8443d40a0dc25fd87cb443dde01ef8e48cfe8","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDcwZjg0NDNkNDBhMGRjMjVmZDg3Y2I0NDNkZGUwMWVmOGU0OGNmZTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/70f8443d40a0dc25fd87cb443dde01ef8e48cfe8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/70f8443d40a0dc25fd87cb443dde01ef8e48cfe8","author":{"name":"qub","email":"5242231+qub@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2023-04-09T03:11:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2023-04-09T03:11:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"efd8e87bf6713b365a4df2e773ab9ae044b84707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/efd8e87bf6713b365a4df2e773ab9ae044b84707"},"message":"Add unix_socket directive to the \"likely wanted changes\" area\n\nThe default config places the control socket in /var/lib/headscale/headscale.sock, causing an error. As noted for the other files this area is not writable in the docker image. I also fixed a double space while I was at it.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if protocol is to also create an issue and link it to this, but please let me know and I'll do that if it's needed.","parents":[{"sha":"d0b3b1bfc45641e8f534d7561a62e2a52cdc936c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d0b3b1bfc45641e8f534d7561a62e2a52cdc936c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d0b3b1bfc45641e8f534d7561a62e2a52cdc936c"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJkMiz7CRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAjFkIAILRAT0YS4PWKINKjOS+eb/Z\nTndCK2svrzQ6FnlvMk3R2+vezDrQ5MkIf6xLiV0fOXYiYvTGVXFcoxQe3CKfFX0U\nQba9+5RXTkl3+BFyl5DKREiMTs3aJyDdfDEqbQdLWMii7wqkDFrfNOGWm8d9500m\n8RRUN39NdMvXnJ4dVqlFcbdeVA8zJFv/GMBv9JLbZUJgRGuGWaDfESKVYSRzR9mq\niXUHeLU8N89ung/l6qm5DECN2qIS/bGGTrCDtZAlrS4XHp4/PExhCEkQ/FL6+tYU\n4SzRqMJOMV1pE4rFhX8Ndm0sz6aT8ASI2zHrKoSueQ01lxS4PnzrqCkV0UH0YeE=\n=/PGO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree efd8e87bf6713b365a4df2e773ab9ae044b84707\nparent d0b3b1bfc45641e8f534d7561a62e2a52cdc936c\nauthor qub <5242231+qub@users.noreply.github.com> 1681009915 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1681009915 -0700\n\nAdd unix_socket directive to the \"likely wanted changes\" area\n\nThe default config places the control socket in /var/lib/headscale/headscale.sock, causing an error. As noted for the other files this area is not writable in the docker image. I also fixed a double space while I was at it.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if protocol is to also create an issue and link it to this, but please let me know and I'll do that if it's needed.","verified_at":"2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"},"event":"committed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1504804232","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1333#issuecomment-1504804232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1333","id":1504804232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz885ZsX2I","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-04-12T07:34:42Z","updated_at":"2023-04-12T07:34:42Z","body":"Hi @qub, I think the more correct way to do